    "long_instructions": "#### Keep your style going\r\n\r\n1. Make a change to your page. Include your 3-word style in your prompt.\r\n2. Try it out. Then make a second change and include your style again.\r\n3. Find the section that's hardest to read. Ask the AI to make it easier to read.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Make the Events cards bigger. Keep it bold, modern, and playful.”*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does each change include your 3-word style?",
